  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a6e2d2e0-51b3-4a45-b1bd-217c6af4f765"],
 " is not specified, it uses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cdc6e9a6-6294-b241-ab9f-f2e08f22ae82"],
 " = size of the largest maximal clique.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"7ab5dd38-b126-4848-a92b-774ef8328a2c"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["FractionInLargestKPathComponent",
